  "headline": "Confidence propels new beginnings for Leo today",
  "general_horoscope": "Leo, today you feel a surge of confidence that encourages you to tackle both personal goals and professional pursuits. Your natural charisma shines, making it easier to engage others and share your ideas. Financial matters may come into focus; consider reviewing your resources or exploring new opportunities with careful attention. Emotional clarity helps you navigate complex situations, ensuring you remain authentic. Socially, your warmth attracts positive connections, fostering teamwork and collaboration. Remember to stay grounded amid the excitement, balancing assertiveness with empathy. Taking time to center yourself will improve your decision-making, bringing a sense of peace. Opportunities arise from your enthusiasm—trust your instincts and step forward with courage.","last_line": "Do this today: reach out to someone whose perspective inspires you."
